  "subtitle": {
    "en": "A small open-source app written for one island, used every day since 2014.",
    "zh": "一个只为一座小岛写的开源小程序，2014 年起每天都有人在用。"
  },
  "public": {
    "story": {
      "en": "There is a small island where people take the ferry every morning to work and school. In 2014 Mira, a programmer who lived there, got tired of the paper timetable blowing away, and wrote this app. It is tiny: one timetable, one line that says how many minutes until the next boat, and a notice that turns on by itself when a storm stops the ferries.\n\nFor twelve years it has had no ads and no accounts, and the code has always been open. Three islanders now take turns looking after it.",
      "zh": "海边有一座小岛，岛上的人每天早上坐渡轮去对岸上班上学。2014 年，住在岛上的程序员米拉嫌纸质时刻表总被风吹走，就写了这个小程序。它很小：一张时刻表、一行“下一班还有几分钟”、台风停航时自动亮起的通知。\n\n十二年来它没有广告，没有账号，代码一直开源。现在由三位岛民轮流照看。"
    },
